fdlibm

The libm of the CPU tier derives from fdlibm (the kernels, the reductions and their
coefficients, as FreeBSD and musl carry them). The files that derive from it are the
libm sources and their baked forms:

  src/core/libm/trig.shade.ts      src/core/libm/trig.generated.ts
  src/core/libm/explog.shade.ts    src/core/libm/explog.generated.ts
  src/core/libm/invtrig.shade.ts   src/core/libm/invtrig.generated.ts

and what the build makes of them under dist/. The notice of fdlibm:

